  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"378\"></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>此模組包為預覽版！所有內容皆已開放，所有結局均可達成！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>1.0 版前可能還有一些平衡性更新！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">Curseforge 自動更新經常重置路徑點與按鍵綁定。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>為在更新時保留這些設定，請安裝至新設定檔，並將「saves」及「journeymap」資料夾，還有「options.txt」檔案複製過去！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>點選</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshorturl.at%252f7HBff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此處</strong></a> <strong>來設定 Java 25！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d4184\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Meatballcraft/bh_promo.png\"></strong></a></span></p><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWVvVm7aWh3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KI1Onh.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"70\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fmeatballcraft-dimensional-ascension%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jOys